This repository contains the AIOS folder template: a folder skeleton and the
instruction files that ship with it. It is published so that anyone — a customer, or
the AI assistant acting for them — can read exactly what an AIOS install puts on their
machine before installing it.

You may read, download, inspect and use this template as part of an AIOS install.

The AIOS skills catalogue is a separate, paid service and is NOT covered by this
repository or this notice. It is delivered from the AIOS skills server and requires a
valid licence.

Redistribution of this template as your own product is not permitted.

For anything not covered here, ask: yellows.one
